# PHASE 27 COMPLETION REQUIREMENTS

Phase 27 is complete only when:

1. The profession framework is reusable and configurable.
2. Players can enroll in multiple professions.
3. Professions have independent progression.
4. Workplaces and facilities are integrated with the game world.
5. Professional assignments support different activity types.
6. Assignments retrieve relevant questions from the existing question system.
7. Existing educational tier and difficulty rules remain respected.
8. Rewards integrate with existing progression, mastery, and economy systems.
9. Career information persists through the existing save/load system.
10. The three seed professions work end-to-end.
11. An additional profession can be added through configuration without engine changes.
12. Existing game systems continue to pass regression tests.

