This Phase 27 replaces the previous Phase 27 gathering-profession implementation plan with the Real-World Professions & Careers direction.

Do not silently delete the original gathering, crafting, or economic gameplay concepts from the overall game roadmap.

Preserve them as possible future systems, including:

- Mining
- Farming
- Woodcutting
- Gathering
- Blacksmithing
- Alchemy
- Crafting
